<title>USA: Vermont lawmakers to draft education bill by Fri..</title>
<headline>Vermont lawmakers to draft education bill by Fri..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vermont state lawmakers are using a lane of the communication highway to get input on education finance reform ahead of a Friday deadline for their Education Reform bill.</p>
<p>The Vermont House Ways and Means Committee last night held a public hearing at the state's interactive television sites on how best to finance schools.</p>
<p>Taxpayers were not short on ideas of how to fix the system, but asked that the solution be equitable and fair.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
